@template brisk
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.3 item 26: crew comment when you wear dirty clothes. clothes.remark: yesterday's clothes
// (flag:clothes.stale); clothes.grubby: a grubby uniform (flag:clothes.grubby, AC3). Bubbles, 60 characters or fewer.
// Kind, never mean: the joke is on the clothes, not on you.
== clothes.remark
? flag:clothes.stale
- Yesterday's shirt. Wardrobe, then carry on.
- Same clothes as yesterday. Noted. Change when you can.
? flag:clothes.stale tier>=friend
- Fresh shirt tomorrow. You'll feel sharper. Promise.   #warm
== clothes.grubby
? flag:clothes.grubby
- Grime on the sleeve. Change before your next job.
- That uniform's done a shift. Two, by the look.   #funny
? flag:clothes.grubby tier>=friend
- Good work, by the state of you. Now go and change.   #warm
